Z||000009||Fiero5||11-14-2000||02:59 PM||||You might be a bad driver period if:<P>you see a sign that says, "Lane ends 500 FT," and you manage to drive in the lane for another 1/2 mile.<BR> <BR>you have the policeman hold your beer while you get your license.<P>you've ever changed a full set of clothes and/or re-done your makeup while on the freeway.<BR> <BR>you've had your license for two months and you're already an experienced ditch digger.<BR> <BR>you find yourself trying to beat that old Ford before she makes it to the crossing. <BR>....and you always lose, but not before it's too late.<P>the garage your having your mod installed by finally gives up and let's YOU attempt to figure out where to put the 8" tail pipe.<BR> <BR>you slow down when coming to green lights... <BR>...and speed up on yellow. <P>you hit a tree and your brother tells you your getting rusty cause you missed the center of the car by a fraction of an inch.<P>you rear end someone at a stop light and then jump out screaming,"Whip lash!!!"<BR>  <BR>you use your knees for steering more than your hands.<BR> <BR>the police department knows your plate number by heart.<P>you take your eyes off the road and both hands off the steering wheel to help your passenger put on their seat belt while driving 65 MPH down the freeway.<BR>  <BR>the police carry separate tickets with your information allready filled out.<BR> <BR>you think red lights & stop signs are a suggestion.<BR> <BR>you've ever asked anyone what a raised finger means because as you say-"I get that all the time."<BR> <BR>you replace your airbag more often than your oil.<BR> <BR>you walk into traffic court and everyone shouts out your name.<P>you get pulled over for drunk driving and you are stone sober.<BR> <BR>you think you have a flat when you hear thump, thump, thump. It's actually just you clipping the orange and white barrels.<BR> <BR>Curb? What curb?<BR>  <BR>you are the only car in the parking lot and you STILL hit a light pole.<BR>  <BR>you stop on an on ramp and wait for "enough room".<P>You drive with your knee's so you can use both hands to tap on the roof through the open sunroof while blasting your tunes.<P>you drive 90 MPH in bumper to bumper traffic and always pass on the right.<BR>  <BR>you have ever hit the car in front of you while YOU were trying to back up.<BR> <BR>you tell your passenger what a good driver you are as you turn into a ditch.<P>you pick on somebody else's car for breaking down, but you have to park your junker in special places so it won't get towed as looking like it was abandoned.<BR>  <BR>you swerve to miss a tree... and it's your air freshener. (Thought the air freshener thread would like that one)<P>all anyone can see when you drive is your knuckles.<BR> <BR>your turn signal is always blinking in the direction opposite to the one you're actually turning.||||reg||1
